              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.1+JER.52.2+JER.52.3+JER.52.4+JER.52.5+JER.52.6+JER.52.7+JER.52.8+JER.52.9+JER.52.10+JER.52.11+JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14+JER.52.15+JER.52.16+JER.52.17+JER.52.18+JER.52.19+JER.52.20+JER.52.21+JER.52.22+JER.52.23+JER.52.24+JER.52.25+JER.52.26+JER.52.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 52.1-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Zedekiah was twenty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned eleven years in Jerusalem. His mother's name was Hamutal the daughter of Jeremiah of Libnah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he did what was evil in the sight of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", according to all that Jehoiakim had done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For because of the anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " it came to the point in Jerusalem and Judah that he cast them out from his presence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
